		"user-action": "Contacted only in response to an explicit user command.",
		"local": "Localhost / loopback.",
		"reference": "URL appears in comments, error text, or help output. Never fetched.",
		"dynamic": "Template host built at runtime. Cannot be allowlisted by name; review when it changes.",
